function positionGroup(pos:string){if(pos==="GK")return"GK";if(["LB","CB","RB","LWB","RWB"].includes(pos))return"DF";if(["DM","CM","AM","LM","RM"].includes(pos))return"MF";return"FW"}
function compatibility(p:Player,slot:string){if(p.pos.includes(slot))return 1;const sg=positionGroup(slot),groups=p.pos.map(positionGroup);if(sg==="GK"||groups.includes("GK"))return .48;if(groups.includes(sg))return .9;if((["LWB","RWB"].includes(slot)&&groups.includes("MF"))||(["LM","RM"].includes(slot)&&groups.includes("DF")))return .82;return .68}
function rawRoleRating(p:Player,slot:string){if(slot==="GK")return p.ovr;const g=positionGroup(slot);if(slot==="ST")return p.pac*.12+p.sho*.43+p.pas*.09+p.dri*.16+p.def*.02+p.phy*.18;if(["LW","RW"].includes(slot))return p.pac*.27+p.sho*.22+p.pas*.18+p.dri*.24+p.def*.02+p.phy*.07;if(slot==="AM")return p.pac*.13+p.sho*.18+p.pas*.31+p.dri*.28+p.def*.03+p.phy*.07;if(slot==="DM")return p.pac*.06+p.sho*.04+p.pas*.27+p.dri*.11+p.def*.33+p.phy*.19;if(["CM","LM","RM"].includes(slot))return p.pac*.11+p.sho*.1+p.pas*.32+p.dri*.21+p.def*.15+p.phy*.11;if(["LB","RB","LWB","RWB"].includes(slot))return p.pac*.18+p.sho*.03+p.pas*.17+p.dri*.11+p.def*.34+p.phy*.17;if(g==="DF")return p.pac*.06+p.sho*.01+p.pas*.08+p.dri*.03+p.def*.5+p.phy*.32;return p.ovr}
function slotRating(p:Player,slot:string){const form=.94+(p.form-1)*.03,fitness=.82+p.fit*.0018;return rawRoleRating(p,slot)*compatibility(p,slot)*form*fitness}
function playerById(id:string){return s.squad.find((p:Player)=>p.id===id)||s.market.find((p:Player)=>p.id===id)}
